INFO  [Claude Code] ## Summary
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] I've successfully resolved all 5 issues reported by Diffblue Cover. The root cause was the same across all issues: the `MarketData.open()` and `MarketReporting.open()` methods were attempting to set the `IP_MULTICAST_IF` socket option to `null`, which is not allowed.
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] ### Changes Made
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] **1. Fixed MarketData.java:71-74**
INFO  [Claude Code] - Added a null check before setting the multicast interface option
INFO  [Claude Code] - The code now only sets `IP_MULTICAST_IF` when `multicastInterface` is not null
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] **2. Fixed MarketReporting.java:73-76**  
INFO  [Claude Code] - Applied the same null check to handle optional multicast interface configuration
INFO  [Claude Code] - The code now only sets `IP_MULTICAST_IF` when `multicastInterface` is not null
INFO  [Claude Code] 
